WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.870
It’s the holiday season.

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:06.020
Outside, it’s cold and there's snow blanketing
the ground.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:10.740
But inside, you’re warm, and gathered around
the light of a roaring fireplace and a glowing

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.230
Christmas tree.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:18.220
This is what Christmas is all about – warmth,
joy, and togetherness.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.400
But just because you’re comfortable doesn’t
mean you’re safe.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.730
You were so busy opening presents and stuffing
yourself at dinner that you didn’t notice

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.680
the face pressed up against the window.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:37.440
That long, gaunt face, with the staring eyes,
the wide mouth full of yellow teeth, and the

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.899
scraggly, white beard.

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:44.059
You don’t know it yet, but within a few
days, you’ll be dead.

00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:48.649
You might be able to avert this horrible fate,
if only you knew what exactly you were dealing

00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:53.850
with: SCP – 4666, also known as The Yule
Man.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:59.920
A Keter-Class Christmas monster so violent,
sadistic, and terrifying, he makes Krampus

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.210
look like jolly Saint Nick.

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:08.750
And this year, just like every other, he’s
planning on being very, very naughty.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:14.600
The SCP Foundation began cataloguing the Yule
Man in 1974 after a string of violent and

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:19.780
eerily similar home invasions during the holiday
season, but they have reason to believe that

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:23.380
this entity has been around for a whole lot
longer.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:26.080
Over 2000 years in fact.

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:30.610
Stories that describe what look to be Yule
Man massacres date as far back as the First

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:35.729
Century BC in Scandinavia, and there have
been reports of similar clusters of events

00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:39.380
happening around the same time every year
since.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:43.940
This monster is prolific, and may have one
of the highest body counts of any creature

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.679
under observation by the Foundation.

00:01:46.679 --> 00:01:51.159
The Yule Man’s trail of destruction became
clearer in the eighteenth century, as accounts

00:01:51.159 --> 00:01:54.039
of the carnage it leaves became more detailed.

00:01:54.039 --> 00:01:59.340
Later still, authorities even managed to find
physical evidence like the Yule Man’s fingerprints

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:03.960
– which are similar to human fingerprints,
but display a distinct double-whorl pattern

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.609
not seen in human fingerprints.

00:02:06.609 --> 00:02:11.209
Much about the anomalous nature of the Yule
Man is still unknown though, and the Foundation

00:02:11.209 --> 00:02:14.470
has yet to discover an effective way to contain
it.

00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:19.510
Their only hope is intercepting it before
it can get its long, gnarled fingers on its

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:21.000
intended prey.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.400
Maybe you’re feeling worried, or that you’re
being watched.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:29.480
You have a good reason to be afraid, because
during his yearly active period – the twelve

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:35.340
days between December 21st and January 2nd
– he’s always searching for prey.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.690
Nowhere is safe, because while it was initially
believed that he only appeared to those who

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:44.960
lived north of 40 degrees latitude, it’s
now believed that much like Santa Claus, the

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.680
Yule Man operates worldwide.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:53.319
Anyone could be in his sights right now, blissfully
unaware of the nightmare coming down the tracks

00:02:53.319 --> 00:02:54.540
towards them.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:59.580
Thankfully, the SCP Foundation, through analysis
of these attacks which are known as Weissnacht

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.660
Events, they’ve been able to find certain
patterns.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:07.220
But first, what does the creature known as
The Yule Man even look like?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:13.519
Much like SCP – 096, the Yule Man is a long
and lanky humanoid standing about two meters

00:03:13.519 --> 00:03:19.060
tall, who resembles an emaciated human of
European descent, and never wears any clothes

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:23.099
or other coverings despite the frigid temperatures
he operates in.

00:03:23.099 --> 00:03:27.510
You might be sad if you’re spending Christmas
alone, but it at least guarantees you safety

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:32.280
from the Yule Man, as he only appears at the
homes of families with a child under the age

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.420
of eight present.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:38.730
He also seems to favor isolated and rural
locations, and Weissnacht Events only occur

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:43.090
when there’s a healthy covering of snow
on the ground during the event – hence the

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:46.379
name which means “White Night” in English.

00:03:46.379 --> 00:03:51.450
It’s also vital that you recognize the three
distinct stages of a Weissnacht Event, too,

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:54.360
or you won’t be seeing much of the New Year.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:57.459
The first stage occurs during the space of
a week.

00:03:57.459 --> 00:04:00.060
Children in the home might start to seem worried
or afraid.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:03.519
They might tell you that they see something
strange in the distance.

00:04:03.519 --> 00:04:08.299
The figure of a man they don’t recognize,
standing just far enough away that you can’t

00:04:08.299 --> 00:04:11.349
fully make him out, except that he’s really
tall.

00:04:11.349 --> 00:04:15.430
Of course, you probably won’t see anything,
and your instinct will be to tell them there’s

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.190
nothing to be afraid of.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.700
Even when they tell you, through tears, that
there’s a man pressing his face up against

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:23.820
their bedroom window at night.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.710
But they are right to be afraid, and you should
be, too.

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:32.389
Already at this point, your only hope is to
try and spread the word as soon as possible:

00:04:32.389 --> 00:04:36.760
Report the incident to the local police, write
about it on Facebook, tweet about it.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.060
Whatever it takes.

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:42.310
The SCP Foundation has operatives trawling
the internet and monitoring police reports

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:47.120
constantly during this period, especially
for reports of mysterious men in the snow

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.780
watching homes from a distance.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:53.520
Getting the Foundation’s attention is your
best hope of stopping this thing.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.720
And if you don’t?

00:04:54.720 --> 00:05:00.419
Next comes stage two, taking place between
nights eight and eleven of the active period.

00:05:00.419 --> 00:05:03.949
No longer will the Yule Man just be lurking
on the periphery.

00:05:03.949 --> 00:05:05.419
Now he’s getting closer.

00:05:05.419 --> 00:05:10.490
You’ll start to hear strange noises in your
attic or on the roof, noises that sound almost

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:11.490
like footsteps.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:15.300
That’s crazy, you think, it’s probably
just an animal.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.430
But then, the smell starts.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:24.020
An awful, rotten stench that fills the house,
but no matter how hard you look, you can’t

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.170
find the source.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.960
Finally, on the last night of December, you
tell yourself that you’ll take this matter

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.259
to the police.

00:05:30.259 --> 00:05:33.270
But of course, it’s already too late.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.840
The Yule Man is here for the twelfth night.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:38.949
The Weissnacht is finally upon you.

00:05:38.949 --> 00:05:42.190
At this point, one of two scenarios will happen.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:47.190
In the first, you and your entire family will
be tortured and murdered, except the youngest

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:49.979
child, who the Yule Man will kidnap.

00:05:49.979 --> 00:05:55.090
The SCP Foundation keeps files on a number
of notable instances of this kind of Weissnacht,

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.900
and the details are truly gruesome.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:03.139
Reports of incidents have involved crucifixion,
the removal of tongues, burning, dismemberment,

00:06:03.139 --> 00:06:06.280
post mortem bitemarks, and decapitation.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:11.229
In all instances though, the entire family
was killed except the youngest child, who

00:06:11.229 --> 00:06:13.040
simply disappeared.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.710
The Yule Man is a merciless and sadistic beast.

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:19.729
You’re now probably wondering: If that’s
the first of two Weissnacht possibilities,

00:06:19.729 --> 00:06:21.319
what’s the second?

00:06:21.319 --> 00:06:26.539
In the second, if you’re tremendously lucky,
you and your family will survive – but that

00:06:26.539 --> 00:06:29.840
doesn’t mean you won’t face a grisly experience.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:34.490
In this scenario, which occurs during about
fifteen percent of Weissnacht Events, you’ll

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:38.530
hear footsteps throughout the night, but thankfully,
you wake up alive.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:42.069
And when you do so, there are gifts waiting
for you.

00:06:42.069 --> 00:06:46.150
The problem is, all these gifts are made out
of human body parts.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:52.590
For example, in 1976 in Canada, one family
received the gift of a ball made from a severed

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.710
human head wrapped in skin.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:07:00.740
In Kazakhstan in 1903, a family received a
flute made from a hollowed out human femur.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:06.560
And in the Netherlands in 2003, a family received
a wooden hairbrush, covered in human teeth

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:11.220
ranging from 400 years old to a mere few days.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:17.360
These gruesome gifts are referred to as SCP
– 4666 – A, and it was one of these gifts

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:22.849
that gave us the best insight yet available
into the true nature of the Yule Man.

00:07:22.849 --> 00:07:28.270
Several gifts were dropped off at a family's
residence in Hoonah, Alaska, in 2018, but

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:38.840
most notable among them was the horrific SCP-4666-A-0960
– a life-sized doll made from a human body,

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:41.940
with its eyes removed and mouth sewn shut.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.880
Worst of all though, was that the girl was
still alive.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.889
The family who received this twisted gift
was given amnestics by the Foundation, and

00:07:49.889 --> 00:07:52.860
the living doll was taken for medical treatment.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:57.680
Before succumbing to her extensive injuries,
the girl was able to deliver some insights

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:02.780
into what exactly happened to the children
who were abducted during Weissnacht Events.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:07.310
The children taken by the Yule Man are forced
into a large sack that seems much bigger on

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:13.220
the inside than it appears as he makes his
rounds, travelling from house to house, murdering

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.610
and kidnapping.

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:20.130
His victims are taken to a kind of underground
grotto and workshop filled with bones, like

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:24.550
a twisted Santa’s workshop, where they’re
forced to make toys out of the bodies of their

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:26.409
fellow victims.

00:08:26.409 --> 00:08:31.210
During this time, the Yule Man will continue
to torture and torment his victims.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:36.270
He’ll even take some of them away to cook
and eat whenever he feels like it.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:40.980
When asked how she was turned into this human
doll, the girl told Foundation personnel that

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:45.690
her fellow victims were forced to turn her
into this by the Yule Man when she became

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:48.800
too weak to continue making toys herself.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:55.820
Her chilling last words were, “When you
can’t make the toys, you become the toys.”

00:08:55.820 --> 00:09:00.660
So if strange things happen to you and your
family between the 21st of December and the

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.350
1st of January, don’t ignore it.

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:06.140
After all, you never know who’s watching.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:11.670
But if it is the Yule Man’s grinning face
pressed up against your window, it may already

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.730
be too late.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.170
Happy Holidays…

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:21.320
Now go check out “SCP – 4000 – Taboo”
and “SCP – 2317 – The Devourer of Worlds”

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:21.820
for more!

